    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27870" root="عبق" body-key="E">
    
      Q. Q. 3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِعْبَنْقَى</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>became cunning,</i> or <i>very cunning:</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَارَ دَاهِيَةً</span>: S, O, K:) or
<i>became evil in disposition:</i> (K:) and in like
manner signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِبْعَنْقَى</span>. (TA.)

